Hi Rob,

I haven't seen any responses yet, so I'm going to take a stab at
it. The answer is "no, PC56 CPUs won't work in a PWS." The PC56
CPUs were touted as "inexpensive Alphas"  and were only used in one
motherboard (that I know of), the PC164SX. They were cheaper than
EV56 CPUs, but didn't perform as well.

